<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">containment-lattice</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

A fine enchanted cage of silver wire, wound tight in overlapping rings
that hum faintly when nothing else is near enough to notice. It was made
to hold a living thing that feeds -- not to starve it, only to keep its
hunger pointed inward, contained, patient. The wire never quite goes
cold, and neither does whatever sits behind it.

