  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting_circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Chrysalis Setting (x1), Binding Paste (x1),
               Mutation Catalyst (x1)

